WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.146
Week 18: Irregular Preterite and Meaning Change. report discoveries and attempts distinguish intention from outcome summarize a trip

2
00:00:09.146 --> 00:00:14.687
Cultural lens. Personal anecdotes as social connection and evidence.

3
00:00:14.687 --> 00:00:26.865
Avoid the single-story trap. Treat country, region, age, relationship, and setting as variables. Describe the evidence you have without turning one example into a universal rule.

4
00:00:26.865 --> 00:00:38.893
Language variation. Recognize regional choices and ask what a form means locally. Use the neutral course model for production until the situation gives you a reason to adapt.

5
00:00:38.893 --> 00:00:47.914
Reflection. Compare this context with one you know. Name one similarity, one difference, and one question that would prevent an assumption.

6
00:00:47.914 --> 00:01:15.793
Model language. No pude entrar porque perdí la llave. — I couldn't get in because I lost the key. Fuimos al pueblo por otra carretera. — We went to the town by another road. Allí conocimos al nuevo alcalde. — There we met the new mayor. Supe la verdad esa misma tarde. — I learned the truth that same afternoon. Quiso ayudar, pero no tuvo tiempo. — He or she wanted to help but did not have time.

7
00:01:15.793 --> 00:01:25.798
Check your readiness. Explain the core idea. Produce an original example. Complete the section assessment at 85% or higher.
